WEBVTT

NOTE
Text descriptions of what is on screen, for people who cannot see the video.
Four short phone clips joined together; the last one was filmed with the
camera turned, so it plays as a tall picture over a blurred background.

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
A brick-walled sports hall with a basketball hoop high on the far wall. Players in purple kit and black eyeshades crouch and lie across the wooden floor in front of their goal, while another player in purple stands at the right-hand side of the court.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
A wider view from the corner of the hall. One player in purple stands at the far end, and the blue bell ball rolls along the floor across the middle of the court.

00:09.000 --> 00:14.000
Three defenders in purple lie stretched out across the floor at their goal line, one diving to the left, as a few spectators watch from a bench along the right-hand wall.

00:14.000 --> 00:19.000
The picture becomes a tall, narrow frame. The blue ball rolls down the court towards the defenders lying at the far goal line, and the picture fades out.
